      "date": "2026-11-20 01:27:32.000000000",
      "message": "Patch Set 2:\n\n(2 comments)\n\nAI code review results below, please doublecheck\n\nThe test change looks correct and should fix the 413a-413d/413h fallout; fine to land, the inline points are for whenever it is next refreshed. Separately, this wait seems to hide a pre-existing LMV problem: after `mdt.*.no_create` is cleared, nothing in the mkdir path re-reads the statfs of a non-parent MDT that the client still caches as NOCREATE, so only `lfs df` (or `lfs mkdir -i N`) makes it usable again. That probably deserves its own LU ticket and lmv patch rather than being absorbed here.",
      "accounts_in_message": [],
      "_revision_number": 2
    },
